# Keeps compiler output and local platform metadata out of the source tree.
# Source, manifests, lockfiles, and inline documentation remain visible by default.
# Generated artifacts are ignored by their conventional root-local names.

/.local/
**/.backend/
/.DS_Store
/result
/result-*
**/.DS_Store
**/target/
**/*.rmeta
**/*.log
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
frontends/csharp/src/legacy/helper/bin/
frontends/csharp/src/legacy/helper/obj/

# Live registry probes and benchmark reports are local evidence, not source
# fixtures. Keep them out of commits while retaining them for review.
.artifacts/
tests/journeys/.artifacts/

# Design-board data caches. The board's extract_*.py scripts regenerate them
# from the local index. The curated page contracts (page6, shapes) that the
# native lanes build against stay tracked.
/Nudox-Design-System/v6/moments/data/*
!/Nudox-Design-System/v6/moments/data/page6/
!/Nudox-Design-System/v6/moments/data/shapes/
